omewhat deeper. It is not — at least, not importantly — in the obvious faggotry of men kissing one another and saying 'I love you,' […]","ref":"1948 November, G[ershon] Legman, “The Psychopathology of the Comics”, in Neurotica, number 3, page 18:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[164,172]],"id":"174f16da-986e-46fa-bee1-60a473d35141"},{"text":"Never­theless we have also observed that rebellion ignored soon falls flat, and most of these \"social rebels\" see the folly of their faggotry in time.","ref":"1962 December, Richard Mayer, “Can We Change Our Swishy Brothers?”, in Mattachine Review, volume VIII, number 11 [misprint for 12], Los Angeles: Mattachine Society, →ISSN, page 35, column 1:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[133,141]],"id":"37b1dfc8-4363-443f-99b3-f1a45ccc2ee4"}],"categories":["English derogatory terms","English offensive terms","English slang","English terms with quotations","English vulgarities"],"links":[["derogatory","derogatory"],["stereotypical","stereotypical"],["behavior","behavior"],["faggot","faggot"],["homosexuality","homosexuality"],["in general","in general"]],"raw_glosses":["(slang, derogatory, vulgar, offensive) The stereotypical behaviors of a faggot (male homosexual) or homosexuality in general."],"glosses":["The stereotypical behaviors of a faggot (male homosexual) or homosexuality in general."],"tags":["countable","derogatory","offensive","slang","uncountable","vulgar"],"id":"c583360b-cdd7-47df-a245-f5cca2cecdbd"},{"examples":[{"text":"\"I was part of a music forum. We used to make techno-collabs with heavy sampling.\" He admitted. […] \"The samples were all from anime and old FDR speeches...\" […] Gerry stopped, and grabbed a nearby tree for support, cackling like a madman. \"I can't stop! I can't...Phil help...I'm trapped in the vortex of your faggotry.\"","ref":"2018, Samuel Eddy, Prima Materia:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[311,319]],"id":"9640a361-95e0-4d49-af8e-8eada6410dba"}],"categories":["English d